Scope (read this first): this PolyForm-Noncommercial licence covers ONLY the
original code, documentation, calculation engine and seed data in this
repository. It does NOT cover third-party data listed in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md — the ERSE CEME list as captured in the original
simulador-original spreadsheet, and the OMIE/MIBEL daily, quarter-hourly and
futures price series. Those keep their own licences/terms (CC BY 4.0). Nothing
from the original spreadsheet is redistributed here: the seed values in
backend/src/db/seed.js are a transcription of publicly published ERSE figures
and carry attribution in README.md and docs/01.

Required Notice: Copyright O Carro Elétrico / Fernando Miguel (https://ceme.ocarroeletrico.com/)

