  Contact: O Carro Elétrico / Fernando Miguel — info@ocarroeletrico.com,
  https://m.me/OCarroEletricoDotCom (commercial licensing requests).

A note on the non-compete term. PolyForm Noncommercial prohibits using the
software to compete with the licensor. For a CEME comparison tool that means a
retailer cannot fork this simulator and run it as a paid offering to consumers
of its own energy. This is deliberate and matches the treatment already used
for nap-dashboard. If a partner needs a different arrangement, ask — the point
of a written carve-out is to have it agreed rather than discovered.

